{
  "format": "souls-form-cases/1",
  "about": "eden:hollow_stump, a hiding place. A search names no thing: its selector (things in this stump, nearest me, first) chooses it as worldd does (#3914). An asker who sees into the stump (its closed audience, the creator) is answered from what it holds; an empty stump is refused none_selected once every need holds. One who does not see into it cannot know: unknown, and the world chooses.",
